{
  "name": "dsh-session-rules",
  "version": "0.8.0",
  "description": "Workspace- and session-scoped rules for DeepSeek Harness · 按工作区/会话分层维护守则，会话里逐层勾选带入，默认关闭",
  "icon": "data:image/svg+xml;base64,",
  "type": "module",
  "license": "MIT",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "prompt"
  ],
  "main": "./dist/index.js",
  "types": "./dist/index.d.ts",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./dist/index.js",
    "./client": "./dist/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "dist",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "icon.svg",
    "README.md",
    "assets"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "manifestVersion": 1,
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "scripts": {
    "build": "tsc -p tsconfig.json",
    "test": "npm run build && node test/selfcheck.mjs"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/node": "^26.6.5",
    "typescript": "^7.0.2"
  },
  "meta": {
    "title": "会话守则 · Session Rules",
    "description": "按工作区层级维护守则；会话里逐层勾选要带入的内容，默认关闭，勾选后才进入系统提示词。写入文件：$DSH_HOME/plugin-data/dsh-session-rules/rules.json。\n\nWorkspace- and session-scoped rules for DeepSeek Harness. Each workspace keeps one rules block and child workspaces can only tick which ancestors they inherit. A session ticks any subset plus its own block; nothing is injected until ticked. Data lives in $DSH_HOME/plugin-data/dsh-session-rules/rules.json.\n\n注意：勾选后这些文字每轮都会随系统提示词发送，会有额外 token 消耗，勾得越多消耗越大。\nNote: ticked rules are sent with every request, so they add token cost every turn."
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/lw0129a/dsh-session-rules.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/lw0129a/dsh-session-rules#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/lw0129a/dsh-session-rules/issues"
  }
}
